Package: kalinka-plugin-roon
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Kalinka-Player <envelsavinds@gmail.com>
Depends: kalinka-server, kalinka-plugin-sdk (>= 3.7), kalinka-plugin-sdk (<< 4), nodejs (>= 18), libasound2 | libasound2t64, libstdc++6, libc6, libicu76 | libicu74 | libicu72, libssl3 | libssl3t64, alsa-utils, ca-certificates, bzip2, curl
Homepage: https://github.com/Kalinka-Player/kalinka-plugin-roon
Description: Roon Bridge endpoint integration for Kalinka
 Downloads the official platform-specific Roon Bridge on enable and displays
 Roon now-playing information with coordinated source switching.
 Requires a Kalinka server implementing the SDK 3.7 external playback API.
